      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_909b5beef58a1109b5dcd37bab5a9f5b4c56ad27c091dcbffac30229b6d0e4cc",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source moves from branch-controlled contour continuation to a completed s-to-1-s symmetry, then rebuilds that symmetry through a theta Mellin transform: Jacobi reciprocity folds the x and 1/x regimes at x = 1, and centering s = 1/2 + ti turns reflection into sign reversal of t in an even cosine representation xi(t).",
